 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "p1",
   "at": 0.7,
   "text": "At VP and C, A.I. is already at work."
  },
  {
   "id": "p2",
   "at": 3.6,
   "text": "A hundred and ten million euros of value. | One hundred percent sourcing adoption. | And more than five hundred ideas, from you."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa1",
   "at": 12.6,
   "text": "It starts with learning. | Prompt Academy."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa2",
   "at": 16.4,
   "text": "Follow guided learning paths."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa3",
   "at": 20.2,
   "text": "Practise on real procurement tasks."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa4",
   "at": 24.3,
   "text": "Get scored on every prompt."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa5",
   "at": 31.4,
   "text": "And watch your skills grow."
  },
  {
   "id": "pa6",
   "at": 34.2,
   "text": "Coming in January."
  },
  {
   "id": "ava1",
   "at": 37.4,
   "text": "Then, answers. | Ask Ava, your A.I. procurement assistant."
  },
  {
   "id": "ava2",
   "at": 42.6,
   "text": "Purchase orders, invoices, contracts, suppliers. | Every answer grounded in approved documents, with its sources."
  },
  {
   "id": "neg1",
   "at": 55.4,
   "text": "Walk into every negotiation fully briefed. | The Sourcing Negotiation Agent scores every bid, | simulates the award, | and lands one clear recommendation."
  },
  {
   "id": "neg2",
   "at": 67.2,
   "text": "A hundred and fifty-four thousand pounds, in projected savings."
  },
  {
   "id": "hw1",
   "at": 73.4,
   "text": "Know the number before the supplier names it. | D to C Product Re-costing prices any hardware model against the latest data. | In seconds."
  },
  {
   "id": "sw1",
   "at": 89.4,
   "text": "For software services, | D to C Should Cost builds a defensible range, | before the first quote arrives."
  },
  {
   "id": "sw2",
   "at": 99.8,
   "text": "Know what it should cost, before you negotiate."
  },
  {
   "id": "obl1",
